    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d566">

                <pb facs="1195" n="1154" xml:id="pg1154"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011EW (Peace)/9–1749</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        French Minister of Foreign Affairs</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Schuman</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-09-17">September 17,
                        1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Minister</hi>: You will recall that at
                    our meeting on September 15<anchor n="1" xml:id="d566-f1"/> it was agreed that a
                    memorandum should be prepared summarizing the conclusions reached with respect
                    to the outstanding issues of the Austrian Treaty, which could serve as a basis
                    for continued negotiations and for any possible informal discussions of the
                    Treaty with the Soviet Foreign Minister. The enclosed memorandum represents our
                    understanding of the agreements reached. I should be grateful for any comments
                    you may care to make or for your confirmation.</p>
                <p>I am sending the same communication to Mr. Bevin.</p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dean Acheson</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d566-a1.xml" xpointer="d566-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d566-f1" n="1" xml:id="d566-f1-content">
                <p>A memorandum of conversation of the meeting of the three Foreign Ministers is
                    printed <hi rendition="#italic">supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
